// P7-AM-A (armies-on-the-map 3.1, 4.1): the standing warbands of the lords. A lord's holding is read from his fief's people (the rows, ascending); the warband is that many men, never more than his purse can pay
// (the wage roll takes at most wage_roll_max_pct of what he takes in a season). The pace is the spec's: riders at the trot (5 m/s = 250 mm a game second), men on foot at the column's 1.3 m/s (65). A task is kept
